== b27_textintoref
  san:    exit 0 textintoref text1-7|
  O3:     exit 0 textintoref text1-7|
  interp: exit 0 textintoref text1-7|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/b27_textintoref.debug.san
--- run san
textintoref text1-7
--- run O3
textintoref text1-7
--- interpret
textintoref text1-7
